{
  "name": "02 - Processing / Duplicate Check",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node-0003",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Duplicate Check\n\nSingle Responsibility: look for an existing transaction within \u00b11 day that matches on amount to catch re-imports (e.g. the same SMS forwarded twice). Not a fuzzy matcher \u2014 amount + same-day date only.\n\nRequires a BudgetFlow service API key with the `transactions:read` scope (BUDGETFLOW_SERVICE_API_KEY env var) \u2014 this scope must be added to the key alongside the write scopes.\n\nInput: output of 02 - Processing / Validate Transaction.\nOutput (not a duplicate): passthrough + { isDuplicate: false } \u2192 forwarded to Categorize Transaction.\nOutput (duplicate found): routes to 04 - Notifications / Import Failed and stops here.\nOutput (API call failed): routes to 04 - Notifications / System Error and stops here.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0002",
      "name": "On called",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "workflowInputs": {
          "values": []
        },
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0004",
      "name": "GET Transactions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        300
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000,
      "continueOnFail": true,
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $env.BUDGETFLOW_BASE_URL + '/api/transactions' }}",
        "authentication": "none",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "={{ 'Bearer ' + $env.BUDGETFLOW_SERVICE_API_KEY }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "startDate",
              "value": "={{ new Date(new Date($json.date).getTime() - 86400000).toISOString() }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "endDate",
              "value": "={{ new Date(new Date($json.date).getTime() + 86400000).toISOString() }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "pageSize",
              "value": "50"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "json",
              "fullResponse": true
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0005",
      "name": "Success?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        800,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "node-0006",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.statusCode < 400 }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0007",
      "name": "Check Fingerprint",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1080,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const original = ($('On called').first() && $('On called').first().json) || {};\nconst httpResponse = ($input.first() && $input.first().json) || {};\nconst items = (httpResponse.body && httpResponse.body.data && httpResponse.body.data.items) || [];\n\nconst targetAmount = parseFloat(original.amount);\nconst targetDate = original.date ? new Date(original.date) : null;\n\nfunction sameDay(a, b) {\n  if (!a || !b) return false;\n  return a.toISOString().slice(0, 10) === b.toISOString().slice(0, 10);\n}\n\nconst match = items.find((tx) => {\n  const txAmount = parseFloat(tx.amount);\n  const txDate = tx.date ? new Date(tx.date) : null;\n  return Math.abs(txAmount - targetAmount) < 0.01 && sameDay(txDate, targetDate);\n});\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...original,\n    isDuplicate: !!match,\n    duplicateTransactionId: match ? match.id : null,\n  },\n}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0008",
      "name": "Is Duplicate?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1360,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "node-0009",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.isDuplicate }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0010",
      "name": "Categorize Transaction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1640,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": {
